39
00:04:31,563 --> 00:04:33,531
What the hell is that ?

40
00:05:01,218 --> 00:05:02,765
Who is your captain ?

41
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:04,893
I am .

42
00:05:05,555 --> 00:05:07,228
Who the devil are you ?

43
00:05:08,058 --> 00:05:09,901
I 've no time to talk .

44
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:13,485
You bring your men and your weapons and follow me .

45
00:05:14,981 --> 00:05:17,951
Now ! Stay where you are .

46
00:05:18,109 --> 00:05:20,203
I give the orders here .

47
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:23,873
[ CREATURE HOWLS ]

48
00:05:25,283 --> 00:05:27,251
Get the dogs ! Get them !

49
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:29,747
Leave them .

50
00:05:31,581 --> 00:05:33,254
They 're already dead .

51
00:05:33,416 --> 00:05:35,760
