52
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:44,052
[ CREATURE ROARS ]

53
00:05:45,428 --> 00:05:47,601
Get back to the ship now !

54
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:50,062
Everybody back to the ship !

55
00:05:51,434 --> 00:05:52,435
[ III ]

56
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:55,113
Bears don 't kill like that , nothing does .

57
00:05:55,272 --> 00:05:57,274
MAN : Maybe it wants the man with the captain .

58
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,487
Or it wants the captain .

59
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:00,323
It 's the devil come for the captain .

60
00:06:00,527 --> 00:06:05,203
For the last time , I made my way from St. Petersburg to Archangel on foot .

61
00:06:05,365 --> 00:06:08,244
From there I took a whaling ship north .

62
00:06:08,410 --> 00:06:11,163
When we hit the ice , I used the dogs .

63
00:06:11,329 --> 00:06:13,331
[ CREATURE HOWLS ]

64
00:06:17,919 --> 00:06:19,762
What 's out there ?

65
00:06:20,714 --> 00:06:22,716
