66
00:06:24,467 --> 00:06:29,439
Listen to me . I have spent six years planning this , my entire fortune .

67
00:06:29,598 --> 00:06:32,977
I will not be stopped by you or some phantom .

68
00:06:33,685 --> 00:06:36,689
Do you share my madness ?

69
00:06:37,981 --> 00:06:41,952
What , then ? No. not madness .

70
00:06:44,112 --> 00:06:48,709
There 's a passage to the North Pole , and I will find it .

71
00:06:48,867 --> 00:06:51,871
At the cost of your own life ? The lives of your crew ?

72
00:06:52,078 --> 00:06:54,627
Lives come and go .

73
00:06:55,206 --> 00:07:00,178
If we succeed , our names will live on forever .

74
00:07:00,337 --> 00:07:05,343
I will be hailed as the benefactor of our species .

75
00:07:05,508 --> 00:07:07,385
You 're wrong .

76
00:07:08,303 --> 00:07:11,682
L , of all men , know that .

77
00:07:11,848 --> 00:07:13,896
Who are you ?

78
00:07:15,518 --> 00:07:17,862
My name ...

79
00:07:19,356 --> 00:07:21,484
is Victor ...

80
00:07:23,109 --> 00:07:25,532
Frankenstein .

81
00:07:37,707 --> 00:07:39,709
[ HARPSICHORD PLAYING ]

82
00:07:40,877 --> 00:07:42,220
Mother !

83
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:46,224
Oh , my wonderful son Victor !

84
00:07:46,383 --> 00:07:49,762
You are the handsomest , kindest , cleverest ,

85
00:07:49,928 --> 00:07:54,058
