106
00:09:27,025 --> 00:09:31,280
You were so hungry for knowledge . Such a serious little boy .

107
00:09:33,865 --> 00:09:36,835
You 've become such an earnest young man .

108
00:09:37,535 --> 00:09:43,292
All these strange and ancient books .

109
00:09:44,542 --> 00:09:47,842
You 'll be an even greater doctor than your father .

110
00:09:50,340 --> 00:09:55,267
But you know , Victor , life shouldn 't be all study .

111
00:09:55,637 --> 00:09:58,015
There 's such fun to be had .

112
00:09:58,681 --> 00:10:00,024
Oh .

113
00:10:00,183 --> 00:10:01,355
Give me that back . No .

114
00:10:01,518 --> 00:10:03,145
Give me that back , Mother .

115
00:10:03,478 --> 00:10:05,480
[ HARPSICHORD PLAYING ]

116
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,942
[ LAUGHING ]

117
00:10:12,028 --> 00:10:14,247
MRS. MORITZ : Change partners . And twirl !

118
00:10:14,405 --> 00:10:15,873
Now , Caroline . You 're right .

119
00:10:16,032 --> 00:10:18,831
You mustn 't exert yourself . Please . I know .

120
00:10:18,993 --> 00:10:22,418
MRS. MORITZ : Don 't worry , madam . Your new baby will be a natural dancer .

121
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:24,332
Excellent .

122
00:10:26,543 --> 00:10:29,547
You 'll be the envy of all the young ladies and gentlemen .

123
00:10:30,672 --> 00:10:31,719
[ HARPSICHORD CLANKS ]

124
00:10:31,881 --> 00:10:34,009
Justine .

125
00:10:34,175 --> 00:10:36,678
Justine , may I have this dance ?

126
00:10:39,305 --> 00:10:40,431
[ LAUGHS ]

127
00:10:41,182 --> 00:10:42,229
[ GRUNTS ]

128
00:10:42,392 --> 00:10:44,394
MRS. MORITZ : Madam ! Hurry !

129
00:10:44,602 --> 00:10:45,728
[ GRUNTING ]

130
00:10:45,895 --> 00:10:47,738
Sir . You must make a decision !

131
00:10:47,897 --> 00:10:50,195
FATHER : How can I ? The baby 's in the wrong position .

132
00:10:50,358 --> 00:10:52,952
I can 't proceed ... I can 't ...

133
00:10:53,111 --> 00:10:54,533
[ MUTTERING INDISTINCTLY ]

134
00:10:55,113 --> 00:10:57,912
Cut me . Save the baby .

135
00:10:59,742 --> 00:11:01,415
[ CAROLINE SCREAMS ]

136
00:11:01,578 --> 00:11:03,376
[ III ]

137
00:11:05,874 --> 00:11:08,252
She 'll be all right .

138
00:11:08,418 --> 00:11:11,592
Your father 's the finest doctor in Geneva .

139
00:11:18,761 --> 00:11:20,104
[ FATHER SOBBING ]

140
00:11:20,263 --> 00:11:21,856
Father ?

141
00:11:23,725 --> 00:11:25,352
Father ?

142
00:11:27,395 --> 00:11:29,363
Father , how is she ?

143
00:11:30,106 --> 00:11:34,828
I did everything I could ... Everything I could ...

144
00:11:34,986 --> 00:11:38,286
VICTOR : Mother ? Mother !

145
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:01,600
Bring her back .

146
00:12:01,930 --> 00:12:05,605
Please , bring her back .

147
00:12:05,767 --> 00:12:06,814
No !

148
00:12:06,976 --> 00:12:10,901
Please , bring her back .

149
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:14,692
