01:07:31,214 --> 01:07:34,468
Not exactly . Where 's your father ?

775
01:07:34,968 --> 01:07:38,142
I said , where 's your father ?

776
01:07:38,304 --> 01:07:39,476
Who 's there ? Maggie ?

777
01:07:40,640 --> 01:07:43,314
No . Oh , it 's you .

778
01:07:43,476 --> 01:07:45,774
What have you done to Maggie ? ls he in there ?

779
01:07:45,937 --> 01:07:47,860
Hiding behind a blind old man ?

780
01:07:48,022 --> 01:07:49,945
Get away ! Get away !

781
01:07:51,985 --> 01:07:54,989
LANDLORD : Don 't blame me .

782
01:07:55,154 --> 01:07:58,499
Blame your son for not paying his rent on time .

783
01:08:01,953 --> 01:08:03,296
[ FLOOR CREAKS ]

784
01:08:06,833 --> 01:08:08,835
[ LANDLORD SCREAMS ]

785
01:08:11,004 --> 01:08:12,756
My God .

786
01:08:14,132 --> 01:08:18,057
Thank you , my friend . Thank you so much .

787
01:08:20,263 --> 01:08:22,482
Won 't you come and sit by the fire ?

788
01:08:24,392 --> 01:08:27,396
Please , don 't be afraid .

789
01:08:28,855 --> 01:08:32,200
Come . Come in .

790
01:08:40,908 --> 01:08:43,206
Have a rest , sit down .

791
01:08:46,873 --> 01:08:48,716
Ah . That 's better .

792
01:08:50,001 --> 01:08:53,301
I 'm glad you finally came in .

793
01:08:54,047 --> 01:08:57,392
A man shouldn 't have to hide in the shadows .

794
01:09:04,349 --> 01:09:08,399
Better that way , for me .

795
01:09:09,729 --> 01:09:11,527
Why ?

796
01:09:13,066 --> 01:09:16,320
People are afraid .

797
01:09:17,236 --> 01:09:19,910
Except you .

798
01:09:21,532 --> 01:09:24,081
It can 't be as bad as that .

799
01:09:28,581 --> 01:09:30,333
Worse .

800
01:09:32,960 --> 01:09:39,309
I can " see " you with my hands , if you 'll trust me .

801
01:09:59,153 --> 01:10:02,157
Papa , Papa , he hurl Grandpa ! FELIX : Who hurt Grandpa ?

802
01:10:02,365 --> 01:10:04,788
MARIE : What was that noise ? FELIX : Tell me what the noise was .

803
01:10:04,951 --> 01:10:06,294
What happened , Maggie ?

804
01:10:07,120 --> 01:10:08,292
Poor man .

805
01:10:14,794 --> 01:10:16,888
Have you no friends ?

806
01:10:20,383 --> 01:10:25,685
There are some people .

807
01:10:29,976 --> 01:10:33,947
But they don 't know me .

808
01:10:34,105 --> 01:10:36,984
Why do you not go to them ?

809
01:10:41,654 --> 01:10:47,536
Because I am so very ...

810
01:10:53,166 --> 01:10:55,134
Ugly -

811
01:10:57,211 --> 01:11:03,184
And they are so very ...

812
01:11:07,805 --> 01:11:10,354
beautiful .

813
01:11:10,516 --> 01:11:13,019
FELIX : Father ! Get out of here !

814
01:11:13,186 --> 01:11:16,190
Get out of here , monster .

815
01:11:16,689 --> 01:11:18,987
Leave him alone !

816
01:11:23,196 --> 01:11:24,869
We have to leave here .

817
01:11:25,031 --> 01:11:27,033
[ SOBBING ]

818
01:11:37,502 --> 01:11:39,504
[ III ]

819
01:12:13,871 --> 01:12:15,748
No .

820
01:12:37,061 --> 01:12:39,063
[ GRUNTS ]

821
01:12:41,232 --> 01:12:43,234
[ III ]

822
01:12:49,156 --> 01:12:51,158
[ ROARS ]

823
01:13:01,168 --> 01:13:05,139
I will have revenge !

824
01:13:07,300 --> 01:13:11,100
Frankenstein !

825
01:13:12,638 --> 01:13:14,640
[ III ]

826
01:13:44,378 --> 01:13:46,506
Geneva .

827
01:14:00,019 --> 01:14:01,737
Yay ! MAN : Quickly , quickly .

828
01:14:01,896 --> 01:14:04,024
She 's here , she 's here ! ELIZABETH : Willie !

829
01:14:04,190 --> 01:14:05,817
We got your letter ! We got your letter !

830
01:14:05,983 --> 01:14:07,906
It 's the first one I was allowed to read .

831
01:14:08,110 --> 01:14:10,204
Congratulations , Elizabeth .

832
01:14:10,363 --> 01:14:13,037
I 'm happy for you . Thank you , Justine .

833
01:14:13,199 --> 01:14:14,872
Oh , is that the locket ?

834
01:14:15,201 --> 01:14:18,375
Oh . Look how handsome Victor is .

835
01:14:18,537 --> 01:14:20,130
Elizabeth , can I take this to show Peter ?

836
01:14:20,289 --> 01:14:21,916
Yes , but , Willie , it 's not a toy .

837
01:14:22,124 --> 01:14:23,922
Let him go . Let him go . Don 't dawdle , William !

838
01:14:29,090 --> 01:14:31,092
[ JUSTINE MRS. MORTIZ LAUGHING ]

839
01:14:32,677 --> 01:14:35,556
Justine , you idiot . Pay attention .

840
01:14:35,721 --> 01:14:38,440
Anyone would think you 're the one that 's getting married .

841
01:14:38,641 --> 01:14:39,938
Yes , Mother . ELIZABETH : What 's wrong ?

842
01:14:40,142 --> 01:14:41,940
JUSTINE : Nothing . Really .

843
01:14:42,144 --> 01:14:44,943
MRS. MORITZ : Just leave it . You 've ruined it now .

844
01:14:49,235 --> 01:14:51,237
[ FLUTE PLAYING ]

845
01:15:13,426 --> 01:15:16,600
No ! No !

846
01:15:28,607 --> 01:15:31,281
Frankenstein .

847
01:15:33,320 --> 01:15:34,446
You , with me .

848
01:15:34,613 --> 01:15:36,615
FATHER : Have you seen Willie ? Isn 't he back yet ?

849
01:15:36,782 --> 01:15:38,705
Claude rode over to find out if he 'd lost track of time .

850
01:15:38,868 --> 01:15:43,294
They say he never arrived . Far too late for him to still be out .

851
01:15:43,456 --> 01:15:45,458
[ III ]

852
01:15:48,711 --> 01:15:51,134
William ! MAN : William !

853
01:15:51,297 --> 01:15:53,299
William ! William !

854
01:15:54,133 --> 01:15:55,931
Willie !

855
01:15:57,303 --> 01:15:59,476
Willie !

856
01:16:00,389 --> 01:16:02,391
[ THUNDER RUMBLING AND MEN SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY ]

857
01:16:05,061 --> 01:16:06,187
[ CRYING ]

858
01:16:06,353 --> 01:16:08,447
Willie ...

859
01:16:08,647 --> 01:16:10,775
Willie !

860
01:16:11,358 --> 01:16:13,827
This isn 't a game !

861
01:16:17,990 --> 01:16:20,334
Willie !

862
01:16:21,952 --> 01:16:24,171
It 's so late .

863
01:16:25,998 --> 01:16:31,550
We 're all so tired . I 'm so tired .

864
01:16:33,130 --> 01:16:37,977
Father ! I 'm so pleased to see you .

865
01:16:43,015 --> 01:16:45,063
What 's wrong ?

866
01:16:51,941 --> 01:16:53,943
[ THUNDER CRASHES ]

867
01:16:55,861 --> 01:16:57,863
[ III ]

868
01:17:01,742 --> 01:17:02,994
[ WHIMPERING ]

869
01:17:04,161 --> 01:17:05,378
[ DOG BARKING IN DISTANCE ]

870
01:17:05,538 --> 01:17:07,165
MAN : William !

871
01:17:16,674 --> 01:17:19,097
VICTOR : We checked the east ridge . There 's nothing there .

872
01:17:19,301 --> 01:17:20,723
Damn !

873
01:17:24,890 --> 01:17:26,233
Elizabeth ?

874
01:17:26,392 --> 01:17:29,612
I found him !

875
01:17:29,812 --> 01:17:33,066
I found him !

876
01:17:36,026 --> 01:17:37,619
Elizabeth !

877
01:17:39,613 --> 01:17:41,411
No !

878
01:17:41,657 --> 01:17:43,580
[ SOBBING ]

879
01:18:14,732 --> 01:18:17,406
We did everything we could , sir .

880
01:18:18,944 --> 01:18:23,370
You just rest easy now . We did everything we could .

881
01:18:24,617 --> 01:18:29,123
MRS. MORITZ : Sir , I 'm terrified for my girl . She 's still out looking for William .

882
01:18:30,247 --> 01:18:34,969
We parted badly . I was cruel to her . I didn 't mean it .

883
01:18:35,127 --> 01:18:41,476
I think she finds it very hard now , with your wedding . She loves you dearly .

884
01:18:41,967 --> 01:18:44,311
I couldn 't bear it if anything happened to her .

885
01:18:44,470 --> 01:18:47,474
She 's all I 've got . Please , help me !

886
01:18:48,891 --> 01:18:51,394
We 'll organize another search now that ifs light .

887
01:18:52,478 --> 01:18:54,606
We will find her , Mrs. Moritz , I promise .

888
01:18:56,649 --> 01:18:58,492
[ SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY ]

889
01:18:58,651 --> 01:19:01,530
How is Father ? His heart is breaking .

890
01:19:04,698 --> 01:19:06,792
[ KNOCKING ON DOOR ]

891
01:19:11,705 --> 01:19:13,503
Mr. Frankenstein ,

892
01:19:13,666 --> 01:19:18,797
we 've apprehended the murderer , not five miles from here hiding in a barn .

893
01:19:19,838 --> 01:19:23,638
We found this on her . It 's yours , I believe , sir ?

894
01:19:27,179 --> 01:19:30,353
Sir , you must come immediately .

895
01:19:31,058 --> 01:19:33,026
The townspeople have gone mad .

896
01:19:33,185 --> 01:19:35,187
[ SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY ]

897
01:19:35,437 --> 01:19:36,484
My God . What are they doing ?

898
01:19:36,647 --> 01:19:38,240
They must have broken into the jail !

899
01:19:38,440 --> 01:19:40,192
Well , for God 's sake , man , can 't you stop them ?

900
01:19:40,359 --> 01:19:42,361
They 've gone wild ! This is a lynching mob !

901
01:19:43,195 --> 01:19:45,664
Stop ! This is unlawful .

902
01:19:45,823 --> 01:19:47,541
Justine . Justine !

903
01:19:47,700 --> 01:19:49,702
[ SCREAMING ]

904
01:19:51,161 --> 01:19:53,163
[ SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY ]

905
01:19:55,874 --> 01:20:00,380
Victor ! Help me ! I was trying to find him !

906
01:20:00,963 --> 01:20:03,887
I went to the lake , but it was dark !

907
01:20:04,049 --> 01:20:06,723
I wanted to bring him to you !

908
01:20:06,885 --> 01:20:13,234
He must be there for the wedding ! I 'm sorry ! He 's so tiny .

909
01:20:14,226 --> 01:20:16,228
[ III ]

910
01:20:22,693 --> 01:20:24,695
[ SCREAMING ]

911
01:20:34,163 --> 01:20:36,165
[ SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY ]

912
01:20:49,094 --> 01:20:51,438
VICTOR : We managed to close the gates on the mob , Claude .

913
01:20:51,597 --> 01:20:53,770
What about Justine ?

914
01:20:54,099 --> 01:20:56,568
We 've cut her down . We can bury her in the morning .

915
01:20:56,727 --> 01:20:59,446
Thank you , Claude . Get to bed .

916
01:21:06,278 --> 01:21:08,531
CREATURE : The sea of ice .

917
01:21:09,740 --> 01:21:12,038
I will meet you there

918
01:21:12,242 --> 01:21:15,416
on the sea of ice .

919
01:21:34,848 --> 01:21:36,691
Oh , Justine , forgive me .

920
01:21:37,643 --> 01:21:40,943
Victor , tell me . Who is this man ?

921
01:21:41,105 --> 01:21:42,152
How do you know he 's responsible ?

922
01:21:42,314 --> 01:21:43,816
I 'll tell you everything after I 've destroyed him .

923
01:21:43,982 --> 01:21:46,076
But if what you say is true , then surely this is a matter

924
01:21:46,235 --> 01:21:48,488
for the police . They wouldn 't understand .

925
01:21:48,821 --> 01:21:50,573
Well , neither do I.

926
01:21:51,824 --> 01:21:53,997
Then just accept it .

927
01:22:09,133 --> 01:22:11,135
[ GRUNTING AND PANTING ]

928
01:22:18,517 --> 01:22:20,519
[ III ]

929
01:23:18,744 --> 01:23:20,417
[ GRUNTING ]

930
01:23:42,267 --> 01:23:43,735
CREATURE : Get up .

931
01:23:44,478 --> 01:23:45,570
Get up .

932
01:23:46,104 --> 01:23:47,777
You do speak .

933
01:23:47,940 --> 01:23:50,819
Yes , I speak .

934
01:23:51,109 --> 01:23:53,111
And read .

935
01:23:54,571 --> 01:23:57,120
And think .

936
01:23:57,950 --> 01:24:00,248
And know the ways of man .

937
01:24:01,203 --> 01:24:02,830
How did you find me ?

938
01:24:07,417 --> 01:24:09,090
Your journal .

939
01:24:13,215 --> 01:24:14,808
Then you mean to kill me .

940
01:24:16,718 --> 01:24:17,970
No .

941
01:24:20,639 --> 01:24:23,984
You murdered my brother , didn 't you ?

942
01:24:26,270 --> 01:24:30,821
I took him by the throat with one hand ,

943
01:24:30,983 --> 01:24:34,658
lifted him off the ground

944
01:24:34,861 --> 01:24:39,332
and slowly crushed his neck .

945
01:24:41,660 --> 01:24:46,336
And as I killed him , I saw your face .

946
01:24:50,377 --> 01:24:56,635
You gave me these emotions . But you didn 't tell me how to use them .

947
01:24:57,843 --> 01:25:00,687
Now two people are dead

948
01:25:01,680 --> 01:25:03,523
because of us .

949
01:25:06,310 --> 01:25:07,527
Why ?

950
01:25:09,771 --> 01:25:15,278
There 's something at work in my soul which I do not understand .

951
01:25:17,195 --> 01:25:20,074
What of my soul ? Do I have one ?

952
01:25:21,325 --> 01:25:25,705
Or was that a part you left out ?

953
01:25:26,788 --> 01:25:31,043
Who were these people of which I am comprised ?

954
01:25:32,878 --> 01:25:35,848
Good people ? Bad people ?

955
01:25:37,049 --> 01:25:40,223
Materials , nothing more . You 're wrong .

956
01:25:43,388 --> 01:25:46,232
Do you know I knew how to play this ?

957
01:25:47,934 --> 01:25:51,734
In which part of me did this knowledge reside ?

958
01:25:52,397 --> 01:25:54,365
In these hands ?

959
01:25:55,025 --> 01:25:57,699
In this mind ? In this heart ?

960
01:25:58,528 --> 01:26:03,830
And reading and speaking .

961
01:26:05,243 --> 01:26:11,421
Not things learned so much as things remembered .

962
01:26:12,542 --> 01:26:15,762
Trace memories in the brain , perhaps .

963
01:26:17,589 --> 01:26:22,220
Did you ever consider the consequences of your actions ?

964
01:26:24,846 --> 01:26:31,149
You gave me life , and then you left me to die .

965
01:26:37,067 --> 01:26:38,785
Who am I ?

966
01:26:38,944 --> 01:26:40,787
You ...

967
01:26:46,284 --> 01:26:48,286
I don 't know .

968
01:26:51,748 --> 01:26:55,093
And you think I 'm evil .

969
01:26:57,421 --> 01:26:59,423
What can I do ?

970
01:27:00,424 --> 01:27:04,804
There is something I want . A friend .

971
01:27:04,970 --> 01:27:06,813
A friend ?

972
01:27:06,972 --> 01:27:08,940
Companion .

973
01:27:09,099 --> 01:27:11,477
A female .

974
01:27:12,894 --> 01:27:15,022
Someone like me .

975
01:27:16,106 --> 01:27:18,200
So she won 't hate me .

976
01:27:18,817 --> 01:27:20,535
Like you ?

977
01:27:22,612 --> 01:27:25,161
Oh , God , you don 't know what you 're asking .

978
01:27:26,032 --> 01:27:29,536
I do know that

979
01:27:30,328 --> 01:27:34,504
for the sympathy of one living being ,

980
01:27:34,666 --> 01:27:38,421
I would make peace with all .

981
01:27:41,631 --> 01:27:44,680
I have love in me the likes of which

982
01:27:44,843 --> 01:27:48,939
you can scarcely imagine .

983
01:27:50,223 --> 01:27:56,572
And rage , the likes of which you would not believe .

984
01:27:58,940 --> 01:28:03,161
If I cannot satisfy the one

985
01:28:04,946 --> 01:28:10,203
I will indulge the other .

986
01:28:12,829 --> 01:28:19,178
And if I consent , how will you live ?

987
01:28:22,506 --> 01:28:26,056
We would travel north , my bride and I ,

988
01:28:26,218 --> 01:28:30,098
to the furthest reaches of the Pole .

989
01:28:30,347 --> 01:28:33,897
Where no man has ever set foot .

990
01:28:34,768 --> 01:28:38,864
There , we would live out our lives

991
01:28:40,482 --> 01:28:41,984
together .

992
01:28:43,068 --> 01:28:47,995
No human eye would ever see us again .

993
01:28:49,407 --> 01:28:52,286
This , I vow .

994
01:28:54,037 --> 01:28:59,009
You must help me . Please .

995
01:29:02,712 --> 01:29:06,762
If it is possible to right this wrong ,

996
01:29:09,094 --> 01:29:11,267
then I will do it .

997
01:29:12,597 --> 01:29:15,441
Victor ! Victor .

998
01:29:15,600 --> 01:29:17,273
Are you all right ?

999
01:29:19,563 --> 01:29:23,443
Yes , I 'm safe . I 'm safe . What happened ?

1000
01:29:24,109 --> 01:29:25,736
Tell us .

1001
01:29:27,404 --> 01:29:29,247
Victor .

1002
01:29:31,449 --> 01:29:34,919
Victor , you have to tell us what happened !

1003
01:29:35,078 --> 01:29:36,671
One month , that 's all I ask .

1004
01:29:36,830 --> 01:29:38,298
And then we can be married ,

1005
01:29:38,456 --> 01:29:40,174
and we can forget this whole business .

1006
01:29:40,333 --> 01:29:43,303
I promise . Promise ? Promise .

1007
01:29:43,461 --> 01:29:45,134
Oh , don 't dare use that word to me .

1008
01:29:45,297 --> 01:29:47,095
You promised to tell me who this man was .

1009
01:29:47,257 --> 01:29:49,009
You promised to abandon this work for good .

1010
01:29:49,175 --> 01:29:51,052
Your promises don 't mean anything . Elizabeth .

1011
01:29:51,219 --> 01:29:52,812
I have to leave this house . What are you saying ?

1012
01:29:52,971 --> 01:29:54,097
Where will you go ? I don 't know .

1013
01:29:54,264 --> 01:29:56,016
Somewhere I can recover . Well , look . This is ridiculous .

1014
01:29:56,182 --> 01:29:57,650
I haven 't got time to argue .

1015
01:29:57,809 --> 01:30:01,609
Oh , isn 't it convenient ? Or doesn 't it fit in with your plans ?

1016
01:30:01,771 --> 01:30:04,820
Don 't you ever think of anyone or anything but yourself ?

1017
01:30:16,828 --> 01:30:18,671
God forgive me .

1018
01:30:22,918 --> 01:30:24,920
[ III ]

1019
01:31:43,289 --> 01:31:45,087
Why her ?

1020
01:31:46,459 --> 01:31:49,884
Materials , remember ? Nothing more .

1021
01:31:50,046 --> 01:31:52,424
Your words . No .

1022
01:31:54,676 --> 01:31:56,644
You will honor your promise to me !

1023
01:31:56,803 --> 01:31:58,680
I will not .

1024
01:31:59,389 --> 01:32:00,936
Go on , kill me now .

1025
01:32:01,099 --> 01:32:03,397
That is mild compared to what will come .

1026
01:32:03,560 --> 01:32:07,781
If you deny me my wedding night , I will be with you on yours .

1027
01:32:09,941 --> 01:32:11,067
Elizabeth !

1028
01:32:12,485 --> 01:32:14,112
Elizabeth .

1029
01:32:14,779 --> 01:32:18,409
Wait . Wait , please wait . Please .

1030
01:32:18,575 --> 01:32:21,954
I have to speak to you . Please !

1031
01:32:31,504 --> 01:32:33,472
What do you want to say ?

1032
01:32:35,258 --> 01:32:37,010
Don 't go .

1033
01:32:37,177 --> 01:32:39,179
[ III ]

1034
01:32:39,596 --> 01:32:44,318
Please , don 't go .

1035
01:32:50,231 --> 01:32:51,858
I 'm frightened .

1036
01:32:55,820 --> 01:32:57,493
Of what ?

1037
01:33:02,118 --> 01:33:07,466
I have done something so terrible ,

1038
01:33:09,334 --> 01:33:12,964
so evil .

1039
01:33:14,672 --> 01:33:20,520
And I 'm frightened that if I tell you the truth

